Tests in asynchronous event pipelines with exactly-once guarantees are challenging. This checks understanding of idempotency, the outbox pattern, and end-to-end test coverage across DB and messaging systems.

## Key Concepts
- End-to-end testing of asynchronous pipelines
- Idempotency keys and replay safety
- Outbox pattern and broker failure modes
- Observability and deterministic assertions

